    %% Local name resolution is handled by the UniFi gateway.
    LANCLIENT -->|DNS query for local hostname| UGW
    UGW -.->|DNS answer: local hostname resolves to host LAN address| LANCLIENT

    %% Local application traffic reaches the host; Caddy handles HTTP(S) reverse proxying.
    LANCLIENT --> SWITCH
    SWITCH -->|HTTP 80 / HTTPS 443 to resolved host address| FW
    FW --> CADDY

    %% Remote access uses either of these independent paths.
    USER_REMOTE --> TW_CLIENT
    TW_CLIENT -->|Twingate private-resource connection| TWIN
    TWIN -->|Authorised private resources\n(exact resource list not captured)| FW

    USER_REMOTE --> WIFI
    WIFI -->|Teleport VPN connection| UGW
    UGW -->|VPN-authorised access to home network| FW

    UBUNTU -. same Docker daemon .-> DOCKER

